      "message": "You\u0027ll need some way to clean this directory between incremental builds, otherwise if you remove a cc_fuzz module the old built artifact will still be lying around here.  Possible options:\n\n1. Add it to the list of directories to clean with installclean\n2. Copy all the files in a single directory as a single rule, then you can rm -rf the directory at the beginning (and zip at the end?)\n3. Skip the copying completely, and do everything with soong_zip arguments: soong_zip -j -P \u003cdirectory in zip\u003e -f \u003csrc\u003e -P \u003cdirectory2\u003e -f \u003csrc2\u003e",
